The reimplementation of agentui's rendering substrate now lives under ui/core/:
the cell grid and its minimal escape-stream emission (ui/core/grid, from
agentui's cellbuf), column-aware wrapping (ui/core/text, from agentui's textwrap),
terminal ownership and input decoding (ui/core/term and ui/core/input, from
agentui's term), frame pacing with in-flight gating (ui/core/present, from
agentui's present), and subsequence ranking (ui/core/fuzzy, from agentui's fuzzy).

agentui states that it is itself an independent Go reimplementation of the
terminal interface of Grok CLI (https://github.com/xai-org/grok-build), and is
not affiliated with or endorsed by xAI.

